<title>USA: UGI Corp to buy back 400,000 shares.</title>
<headline>UGI Corp to buy back 400,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>UGI Corp said Tuesday it will buy back up to 400,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchases will take place from time to time on the open market, it said. It has about 33.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to use the reacquired shares for its dividend reinvestment program and other corporate purposes.</p>
<p>UGI is a holding company with utility and propane marketing subsidiaries.</p>
